[Script]
# DDXQ (叮咚买菜)：本地独立脚本，GPL-3.0-or-later
http-response ^https?:\/\/maicai\.api\.ddxq\.mobi\/tool\/getConfig requires-body=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ashun520/loon-rules/main/AdUltraPlus/Scripts/ddxq.js
